+# Revision6 policy and representation ledger
+
+Policy changes: P1 exact family/schema contradictions and full identity equality; P2 reporting presence/count boundaries and successful terminal completeness (explicit V5 ambiguity resolution); P3 UniqueReservation applicability; P4 S/F financial finalization and uniform external obligation; P5 separately trusted verification and residual allocation interpretation; P6 raw-based selected-case scope including missing-launch negatives. D3 explicit tooling-only amendment. Exact authority is POLICY-R6.
+
+Representation-only changes: canonical stable IDs, fixed schema, generated repeated views, registered dependency invalidation, SHA256 identities and structural partition checks. These establish consistency only, never financial correctness. Historical decision/finding/changelog content remains independently attributable; superseded policy is not erased.
+
+Outstanding gates: independent raw-policy oracle agreement, meaningful historical negatives/controls, legacy check/selftest/revisions/sabotage, complete exact A/C and relevant B clearance, reviewed freeze; S2a location/budget/entry separate.
